	optdepends = doubletake-git: AirPlay mirroring and extend support (the 0.4.0 release cannot capture on Hyprland)
	optdepends = walker: device picker menu (older Omarchy; current Omarchy uses its own menu)
	optdepends = waybar: status indicator (current Omarchy uses the bundled Quickshell widget)
	optdepends = libnotify: desktop notifications on failure
	optdepends = gst-plugins-ugly: software x264 encoding fallback
